    "enUS": {
      "description": " Grabbing onto it, you pull the pack back to the shore. Perhaps if you examine the items inside the pack, you might find out more about who it belongs to.\n\nThere are a few stray travelers at Marshal's Refuge. Perhaps you might find out more there.",
      "dialogue": {
        "8d6420cc91f3243eb5d5": "Hi there. I've seen you before... Haven't I?",
        "fbdf8ecfa421de8e92ee": "Oh... Yes, these things do look familiar... well, kind of..."
      },
      "summary": "Examine the items inside the pack and bring them to their owner.",
      "title": "It's a Secret to Everybody",
